WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.202
Giannis Farazis serves families and professionals

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:06.359
across Cyprus, in Greek and English.

3
00:00:07.459 --> 00:00:10.430
His office is in Nicosia, on Strovolou Avenue.

4
00:00:10.896 --> 00:00:14.390
Most in-person meetings happen there, and whenever it suits you,

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:18.522
the same conversation can happen by video call or by phone.

6
00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:24.637
From Limassol, Larnaca, Paphos or the free Famagusta district,

7
00:00:24.881 --> 00:00:27.702
the simplest way is often a video call:

8
00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:31.661
it is just as complete a conversation, without the drive.

9
00:00:32.126 --> 00:00:35.562
If you would like to meet in person, you arrange it with him.

10
00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:38.809
The service is the same everywhere:

11
00:00:38.996 --> 00:00:42.756
a first conversation, a proposal in plain words,

12
00:00:42.815 --> 00:00:45.125
and help when you need to claim.

13
00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:48.593
For a first conversation with no commitment,

14
00:00:48.617 --> 00:00:52.354
call plus three five seven, nine seven, eight four zero,

15
00:00:52.413 --> 00:00:55.477
nine four one, or send a WhatsApp message.
